{"id":"aca_","lemma":"acá","pos":"adv","rank":610,"glosses":["here (in the speaker's location)","as of, up to (used with a time phrase to represent continuity up to the present)"],"ipa":"/aˈka/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/2/23/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Guergana-ac%C3%A1.wav","examples":[{"text":"¿Qué están haciendo ustedes acá?","en":"What're you guys doing here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/594894","words":[{"g":"what"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"you all"},null]},{"text":"Me voy a quedar acá.","en":"I'll stay here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/440815","words":[{"g":"me"},{"g":"to go","l":"ir"},{"g":"to"},{"g":"to be , to end up"},null]},{"text":"No te queremos acá.","en":"We don't want you here.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/460172","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to desire","l":"querer"},null]},{"text":"¿Puede escribir su nombre acá?","en":"Can you write your name here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/598978","words":[{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to write"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"name"},null]},{"text":"¿Cómo sabías que estábamos acá?","en":"How did you know we were here?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/590250","words":[{"g":"how"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"that"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},null]}]}